WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.250
An if lets the sketch decide, and turns the circle round at an edge

2
00:00:04.778 --> 00:00:09.703
A variable for the place, and one for the speed. A negative speed goes left.

3
00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:15.753
if checks a condition. When x passes 280, the speed turns round.

4
00:00:20.837 --> 00:00:25.712
The circle bounces. The two bars mean or: either edge can turn it round.
